---
Create unit tests for subtractive synth engine.

Verify oscillators, ADSR, filter, LFO, and unison work correctly.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Test each waveform (sine, saw, square, triangle) produces non-zero output
- [ ] Test ADSR envelope shape: attack ramps up, decay ramps down, sustain holds, release ramps to zero
- [ ] Test biquad filter attenuates frequencies above cutoff
- [ ] Test LFO modulates target parameter
- [ ] Test unison detuning produces wider stereo image
- [ ] Test note-on/note-off lifecycle

## Test Plan
- [ ] Build and run synth_test target
- [ ] Render single notes with each waveform, verify waveform shape
- [ ] Render note with known ADSR, verify amplitude envelope
- [ ] Render note with low cutoff filter, verify high frequencies attenuated
- [ ] Compare mono vs unison output
